            "`TBD` (optional pattern, pending implementation decision)"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3. Focus management"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Focus order should follow visual item order from left to right."
          },
          {
            "text": "No focus behavior is explicitly defined in Figma; implementation details are `TBD`."
          },
          {
            "text": "Focus outline tokens should use `Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Inner` and `Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Outer`."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "4. Labeling"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Each item label should be unique and meaningful."
          },
          {
            "text": "Icon-only usage is not defined; if introduced, labeling strategy is `TBD`."
          },
          {
            "text": "`aria-describedby` usage is `TBD`."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "5. Contrast and visibility"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Selected vs non-selected states must remain distinguishable without relying on color alone."
          },
          {
            "text": "Contrast verification is `TBD (pending audit)`."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Hit area requirements"
      },
